WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.283 --> 00:00:01.086
Toh is baar jab

2
00:00:01.106 --> 00:00:02.182
tum apne mohalle ka

3
00:00:02.202 --> 00:00:03.704
julus dekho — dhol,

4
00:00:03.724 --> 00:00:05.199
rang, hazaron log ek

5
00:00:05.219 --> 00:00:06.191
saath chalte hue —

6
00:00:06.211 --> 00:00:08.024
Ek pal ke liye

7
00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:09.229
soch lena.

